<title>HONG KONG: Guangzhou Inv plans concrete investment.</title>
<headline>Guangzhou Inv plans concrete investment.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd said in a statement on Wednesday it would spend about 100 million yuan on investing in existing ready mix concrete stations over a period of two to three years.</p>
<p>The statement gave no further details in clear terms.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
